\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The platform carrying a grasped can (left) and the two target objects in the arena (right). The can is a 250\,ml slim aluminium can, 53\,mm in diameter and 133\,mm tall, weighing about 11\,g empty. The bin is a cardboard box roughly 5\,cm tall with the printed \texttt  {tag36h11} marker on its side. Both photographs are frames from the recorded hardware demonstration.}}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
